Implemented
===========
- Dashboard Mainnet Health card backed by authenticated local getmainnethealth.
- GREEN/YELLOW/RED/CRITICAL badge and RED/CRITICAL GUI warning banner.
- Height, blocks-behind, connections, supply invariant, best block hash, state-root and protocol display.
- Mainnet-only semantics; non-Mainnet networks display N/A instead of misleading health data.
- Local-only Peer Viewer with host/domain/IP, port, basic type classification and raw peer status.
- getpeerinfo primary path with listpeers fallback.
- No external GeoIP/DNS/ASN service or peer-list upload.
- Peer table uses DOM textContent for untrusted daemon strings.
